    "description": "{\"description\":\"Extreme Chaos Fishing Charters offers inshore, nearshore, and offshore fishing adventures in Orange Beach, Alabama. Led by Captain Doug Maines (aka 'Captain Chaos'), the company provides expert-guided fishing trips targeting various saltwater species including Red Snapper, Vermilion Snapper, Triggerfish, King Mackerel, Redfish, and more. The service includes all fishing gear, bait, safety equipment, fish cleaning, and expert guidance.\",\"elevator_pitch\":\"Expert-guided charter fishing trips in Orange Beach, Alabama with Captain Doug Maines offering inshore, nearshore, and offshore fishing experiences for all skill levels.\",\"vibe\":\"Adventure-focused, family-friendly, professional fishing charter with experienced captain and crew dedicated to creating memorable fishing experiences.\",\"best_for\":[\"families\",\"first-time anglers\",\"experienced fishermen\",\"kids\",\"group adventures\"],\"established\":null,\"reservations\":\"Online booking available; phone booking accepted at (228) 365-2352\",\"insider_tip\":\"2026 Snapper Season starts in May with limited availability - call early to book your charter.\"}",
